+// PNGs) to read five bytes of metrics per glyph. FileFaceBitmaps does what
+// HarfBuzz 2.3.0 does (hb-ot-color-cbdt-table.hh, CBDT accelerator, and the
+// em scaling of hb_ot_get_glyph_extents) with CBLC mapped and the glyph's
